son Brandon Mo, over which shares Mr.&#160;Mo disclaims beneficial ownership, as Mr.&#160;Mo has no control over the dispositive or voting
power over the shares and his sons no longer live in the same household as Mr.&#160;Mo. Does not include a restricted stock award of 437,500
shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock that does not vest or settle within 60 days. Mr.&#160;Mo beneficially owns an aggregate of
1,000,000 shares of Non-Convertible Series&#160;A Voting Preferred Stock (the &#8220;Preferred Stock&#8221;). Each share of the Preferred
Stock entitles Mr.&#160;Mo to votes equal to one hundred votes per share of Preferred Stock held.</span></td></tr>
